<title>RUSSIA: MICEX starts Russia T-bill real-time quote system.</title>
<headline>MICEX starts Russia T-bill real-time quote system.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) has begun transmitting quotes of Russian GKO discount government T-bills and OFZ government bonds in real time on Reuters terminals, Reuters and MICEX said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
